Package: inevitable
Type: Package
Title: Risk-Based Pricing of Life Insurance and Annuities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pratham", "Sood", email = "prathamsood1002@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A life contingencies pricing engine built from first principles.
    Laws of mortality, select mortality and extra risk; expected values,
    variances and full distributions for 19 insurance and annuity products;
    m-thly and continuous benefits by exact sums, UDD and Woolhouse;
    net premiums by the equivalence, percentile and portfolio percentile
    principles; premium refunds; and the natural hedge between life insurance
    and annuities. All assumptions are illustrative and not calibrated to real
    data.
